  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a sygican ranged weapon.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Cost</strong> 2 battery charges</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You have modified your weapon to have magic that allows shots fired to veer toward your targets. You Ingrave your weapon with the following effect.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Ingrave (Manipulate, 2 charges) </strong>You make a Strike with your weapon and gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your attack roll and ignore the target’s concealed condition. If the target is hidden, you reduce the flat check from being hidden from 11 to 5.</p>"
